WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.084
Bonjour!

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:02.669
Bienvenue!

00:00:02.753 --> 00:00:04.254
Thank you all for coming.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:07.257
This show is full of pieces

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:09.134
we've been told
to keep hidden.

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:11.261
We're impressed upon

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:13.347
to enhance our bodies,

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.224
but we're not supposed
to talk about it.

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:17.684
Well, this collection

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:20.604
was designed to be seen.

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.272
This collection

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:25.067
was designed to be loud.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:34.451
I would love to welcome

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.120
a very dear friend

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:38.205
and mentor,

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.416
who taught me everything
I needed to unlearn

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.918
to create
this collection today.

00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:45.629
I believe that
he's here with us now.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.047
Pierre Cadeau.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.760
Pierre? Where are you?

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.952
What the hell's going on?
This isn't in the timeline.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.046
You magnificent bitch.

00:01:32.843 --> 00:01:34.136
Long live the king!

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:39.349
Well,

00:01:39.433 --> 00:01:41.268
now that that's over,

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:42.769
mesdames et messieurs,

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:45.355
let them eat cake.

